# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Files in public/ are copied into out/, which is
# what gets published — a file at the repo root would never reach the host.
#
# The course was "Open Harness", then "Own Your AI", and is now
# "My First AI Agent". Old links are in readers' bookmarks and in the wild,
# so the old paths keep resolving. The exported HTML at those paths also
# self-redirects (see app/components/LegacyRedirect.tsx) for hosts that do
# not read this file.
